  "id": "sequela",
  "term": "sequela",
  "definition": "A sequela is a condition or lasting problem that develops as a consequence of an earlier injury or illness. In this context, chronic ankle instability is described as a sequela of a lateral ankle sprain because it can follow that sprain and persist afterward.",
